{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: One-Armed Crayfish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content: Visual Novel Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout the Translation Patch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A volunteer has kindly created an English translation patch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please refer to the Community Hub.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis is because we cannot include external links on the store page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bWe do not provide support for the translation patch here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSynopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGoing against the grain is just another form of rebellion,\u201d says high school student Yuta Nozaki, who lives by the creed of always going with the flow. This approach allows him to live peaceful days. However, through his classmate Misaki Miyoshi, who constantly goes against the grain in everything, he begins to confront his true feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is a linear path with no branching, offering about 1-2 hours of content. There are no character voices. A key feature is that illustrations progress almost entirely through still images, without using standing character sprites. (See screenshots)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRegarding Gameplay Commentary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream or record gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509770?t=1767103892","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767103892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509770/03d010f0dff27e93a2eed5967e020060351659e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767103892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509770/03d010f0dff27e93a2eed5967e020060351659e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767103892","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: One-Armed Crayfish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content: Visual Novel Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout the Translation Patch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A volunteer has kindly created an English translation patch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please refer to the Community Hub.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis is because we cannot include external links on the store page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bWe do not provide support for the translation patch here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSynopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGoing against the grain is just another form of rebellion,\u201d says high school student Yuta Nozaki, who lives by the creed of always going with the flow. This approach allows him to live peaceful days. However, through his classmate Misaki Miyoshi, who constantly goes against the grain in everything, he begins to confront his true feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is a linear path with no branching, offering about 1-2 hours of content. There are no character voices. A key feature is that illustrations progress almost entirely through still images, without using standing character sprites. (See screenshots)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRegarding Gameplay Commentary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream or record gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u659c\u5854\u30bd\u30f3\u30d6\u30ec\u30ed"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509770/header.jpg?t=1767103892","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509770/822537/f27b6f2707487f38689b205234c0bcfcf6e4f00b/1750856934/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740039372","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509770/822537/f27b6f2707487f38689b205234c0bcfcf6e4f00b/1750856934/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740039372","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3509770/822537/f27b6f2707487f38689b205234c0bcfcf6e4f00b/1750856934/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740039372","id":257094464,"name":"OP","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094464/00aa9dd381a263abe3bc1b00adb2c1ac58412e23/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740039372"}],"name":"\u7247\u8155\u306e\u30b6\u30ea\u30ac\u30cb - one-armed crayfish","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u7247\u8155\u306e\u30b6\u30ea\u30ac\u30cb - one-armed crayfish - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$2.99</span> $2.39 USD","packageid":1239160,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":239}],"title":"Buy \u7247\u8155\u306e\u30b6\u30ea\u30ac\u30cb - one-armed crayfish"}],"packages":[1239160],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str